WEBVTT

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.536
[upbeat song playing]

00:02:23.578 --> 00:02:25.872
'cause you've seen it all ♪ ♪ You come

00:02:25.914 --> 00:02:28.333
♪ One day though you take the fall ♪

00:02:28.374 --> 00:02:30.460
