00:02:56.569 --> 00:02:58.488
♪ I promise you ♪

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.952
♪ Wind blows and heaven knows ♪

00:03:03.994 --> 00:03:07.121
♪ That sun can turn to rain ♪

00:03:07.163 --> 00:03:11.250
♪ There's nothing much to fear though ♪

00:03:11.292 --> 00:03:16.548
♪ Doors close and we all know that love can turn to pain ♪

00:03:16.589 --> 00:03:20.760
